        },
        {
          "text": "Riameno Rwoth Were waco ama: Paka mbawo yath vini i dier yen ma lul, m'atieko miyo mac owaŋo woko to liel, ameno apaka alatimo ri ji ma jobedo i Yerusalem. ",
